  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources cover Cedar Hollow's 2025-26 winter warming center: a season report, a council work session, and a guest and volunteer survey.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center: Season Report, 2025-26”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_e146871b9019"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P11",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_1ce2b6497fe3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The center was open 87 nights and recorded 2,914 overnight stays by 412 different guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The season cost $318,400, or $109 per overnight stay, paid by the city, a county grant and private donations.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What it cost”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend opening earlier, a warmer 35-degree trigger, and a second east side site that would add $142,000.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[1:02]",
            "source_id": "s_e146871b9019"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The mayor put the second site and earlier opening on the April 8 budget work session agenda.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P10",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[3:10]",
            "source_id": "s_e146871b9019"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "On January 21, 61 guests stayed in a hall set up for 60. If the trigger rises from 32 to 35 degrees, can one hall handle more nights?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_3d501a01b89e"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_e146871b9019"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "74 percent of guests said getting there was the hardest part. Does one east side site at Ridge Avenue solve the Fifth Street bridge problem?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P13",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_1ce2b6497fe3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
